              "pos": { "x": 1448.0, "y": 621.0 },
              "contents_type": "Job",
              "contents": { "type": "" },
              "function_category": "Default Node",
              "description": "Decodes a SMPTE ST 12-2 Ancillary Timecode (ATC) packet from an ANCFrame and emits the decoded\nTimecode struct (HH:MM:SS:FF + drop-frame flag + ATC source) along with a Valid flag.\n\nFor SDI input via AJA, the AJA In node's Timecode output pin is the recommended source \u2014 the\nAJA hardware extracts RP188 ATC through its dedicated path. Use this node on ANCFrame data\nfrom non-AJA inputs (2110, file readers) or when you specifically need to decode an ATC packet\nthat reached you as ANC data.",
              "display_name": "Extract Timecode",
              "plugin_version": { "major": 2, "minor": 10, "patch": 0 }
            },
